{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Measurements (macOS dev host, git 2.56). Each spawn inside `jobs.run_job` was recorded by wrapping `subprocess.Popen.__init__`, together with its rebar caller.\n\nBefore (main 90d57e392ba, 1-min load average 29.9-30.1):\n- completion PASS (`test_completion_pass_binds_server_derived_values`): 53 spawns (49 git + 4 ssh/ssh-keygen); run_job 4.78 s\n- completion FAIL (`test_completion_fail_completes_with_null_envelope`): 32 spawns; run_job 2.8 s\n- `pytest -n0 tests/unit/test_opcert_service.py tests/unit/test_opcert_service_integrity.py`: 14 tests, 59.4 s wall time (load average 30.3 at start, 26.1 at end)\n\nAfter (commit \"Cut git process starts in opcert run_job\", 1-min load average 38.5-39.2):\n- completion PASS: 34 spawns (30 git + 4 ssh); run_job 2.53 s\n- completion FAIL: 18 spawns; run_job 1.52 s\n- Same 2 modules, now 16 tests (2 new): 49.5 s wall time (load average 34.8 at start, 28.1 at end)\n\nPer caller, PASS job, before -> after:\n- workspace `_populate` + `discard`: 17 -> 7 (removed 2 `remote add`, 2 `remote remove`, 6 `git config`, `worktree prune`; fetch by URL; identity written to `.git/config` once)\n- `ensure_fresh` freshness: 7 -> 0 (6 `rev-parse --verify tickets` + 1 failing `fetch origin`; job runs under `local_read_context`)\n- signing `head_sha`: 2 -> 1\n- ensure sweep 13, event write path 9, `_gate_commit_sha` 2, ssh 4: unchanged\n\nWall times come from single runs at different loads, so they bound the effect rather than measure it precisely.\n\nVerification: `pytest -k spawn_ceiling` failed on main (49 > 30 git, 32 > 18) and passes on the change. The opcert/MCP/store/ensure/signing module set gave 764 passed, 5 skipped. `make lint` and `make typecheck` pass. Complexity check: `new=0 increased=0`. Changed files: 159, 215 and 493 lines."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793780482006499001,"uuid":"68557b9e-7700-40b3-a4f2-4ab3ee761ac6"}